	quest.01A8C8BA2C5EFB2C.quest_desc: ["&3Usage: Put against either a pipe set to extract or on a machine thats set to insert and a pattern with the recipe your trying to automate, then go to your terminal and request said item, Make sure you have it set to import back into ae2 else you wont see the item / craft wont complete intill it enters ae2"]
