	quest.11F5FFBA166718BD.quest_desc: ["Electron Tubes are used in some of the more advanced Create recipes, and require Polished Rose Quartz to craft. This can be automated eventually, but for now hold Rose Quartz in one hand and Sand Paper in the other. Hold down Right-Mouse Button in order to craft Polished Rose Quartz"]
