	quest.133697F1B49ECF4D.quest_desc: ["Fluix cables are used to connect devices and transfer channels. The basic version can only carry 32 channels at a time."]
	quest.133697F1B49ECF4D.quest_subtitle: "Ethernet Cables"
	quest.13C62073194F6B87.quest_desc: ["Andesite Casing is very essential in Create, you'll need a lot of this. It is created by right-clicking a stripped log while holding at least one andesite alloy."]
	quest.13C62073194F6B87.quest_subtitle: "Wooden Machinery"
	quest.1407597631E47728.quest_desc: ["Used to create patterns, which are used in pattern providers to automate recipes, both crafting and not."]
