	quest.20F15B37DF363651.quest_desc: ["&b&lSet of Diamond Armor"]
	quest.20F15B37DF363651.title: "Diamond Armor"
	quest.225F0EB51DD4E2C6.quest_desc: ["Using two Crushing Wheels you can mass crush items, with a much greater throughput and speed than the Mechanical Crusher."]
	quest.225F0EB51DD4E2C6.quest_subtitle: "Gordon Freeman Vs. Garbage Compactor"
	quest.232C9E5D1CF43DE9.quest_desc: ["Functions the same as a small cogwheel, except its' bigger. Can be used in conjunction with a regular cogwheel as a primative method to change rotation speed."]
	quest.232C9E5D1CF43DE9.quest_subtitle: "Bigger Spinner"
	quest.268AC29BEC840159.quest_desc: ["Copper Casings are used for fluid-based Create machines."]
	quest.268AC29BEC840159.quest_subtitle: "Get To The Copper!"
	quest.2806075C636BE7F0.quest_desc: [
		"&cSpatial IO&r is a way to cut-and-paste physical volumes of space in your world. It can be used to move &bFlawless Budding Certus Quartz&r, have a room in your base where you can swap out various interiors to use it for different purposes, or even move the end portal!"
		""
		"It works by swapping the defined volume with an identically-sized volume in the spatial storage dimension, sending whatever's in the pylon array to the spatial storage dimension, and whatever's in the dimension to the pylon array."
		""
		"This means that if you have a way of travelling between dimensions (&cspatial IO&r can be used to make a teleporter, but doing it is very complex, a bit janky, and beyond the scope of the guide), you can use them like custom-sized compact machines or pocket dimensions."
	]
	quest.2806075C636BE7F0.quest_subtitle: "Inter-dimensional base!"
	quest.287E469DA8D74B88.quest_desc: [
		"the first machine you'll ever make in mekanism capable of making 3 tiers of alloys and circuits, the circuit is named &aBasic control circuit&r, the others is: &cInfused alloy&r, &bReinforced Alloy&r, &dAtomic Alloy&r"
		""
		""
		""
		"&4just put redstone in the power slot till you make a wind generator lol"
	]
	quest.288A6595DD097A45.quest_desc: ["The large water wheel functions the same as a normal water wheel, except it has a much higher stress capacity. The downside is it spins much slower."]
	quest.288A6595DD097A45.quest_subtitle: "Stronk Spin"
	quest.28F02F89010A3B67.quest_desc: ["Create is an automation based mod that can do anything from trains to ore doubling to making a rotating house. It has something for everyone and is visually pleasing. I would highly reccomend you make use of the Ponder feature of Create, which can be accessed by hovering over a specific block from the mod, and holding the \"w\" key."]
	quest.28F02F89010A3B67.quest_subtitle: "Create > Immersive Engineering"
	quest.2975991588249825.quest_desc: ["Andesite Alloy is an essential component of Andesite Casings, which are used in most machines."]
	quest.2975991588249825.quest_subtitle: "The Building Blocks of Building Blocks"
	quest.2B61CB4F8EA7F294.quest_desc: ["Used in conjunction with the basin to do various mixing recipes."]
	quest.2B61CB4F8EA7F294.quest_subtitle: "Mixed Feelings"
	quest.2CA3E71332D2AC95.quest_desc: ["The Mechanical Harvester can be used to automatically harvest most crops, including underwater."]
	quest.2CA3E71332D2AC95.quest_subtitle: "Better Than Barbed Wire"
