	quest.3826E8923DCF97BB.quest_desc: ["Used to access storage cells on an AE2 network."]
	quest.3826E8923DCF97BB.quest_subtitle: "Jesus Christ It's Jason Bourne"
	quest.388C13AE05BDB250.quest_desc: ["The depot can be used for temporary item storage for an item that will be used in a recipe. For example, if you place a depot below a mechanical press, and then put iron ingots on it, the ingots will not despawn, but the press will still turn them all into plates."]
	quest.388C13AE05BDB250.quest_subtitle: "Standing Here"
	quest.3A75739399C1FD7A.quest_desc: ["Used to control a train."]
	quest.3A75739399C1FD7A.quest_subtitle: "I Like Trains"
	quest.3A7DE79466515B70.quest_desc: ["Is used to automate crafting table recipes and nothing else"]
	quest.3A7DE79466515B70.quest_subtitle: "The Way of The Craft"
	quest.3D60968E28DC0B39.quest_desc: ["Obviously theres so much more to this mod but this is what i believe to be the most fun to play around with."]
	quest.3E9EAF6653B739C8.quest_desc: ["The Mechanical Press can be used to compress various items into different forms, as well as turning ingots into plates."]
	quest.3E9EAF6653B739C8.quest_subtitle: "Pressing Matters"
	quest.3EC76E0EB1E34EED.quest_desc: ["Inserting Storage Cells into the ME Drive will allow massive amounts of storage. One ME Drive can hold up to 10 Storage Cells."]
	quest.3EC76E0EB1E34EED.quest_subtitle: "(Almost) Unlimited Storage"
	quest.3EF66440860597BD.quest_desc: ["The game starts here. Make your 1st crafting table"]
	quest.3F5C2249AD1A1556.quest_desc: ["The deployer has two uses. The first is placing/clicking blocks. The second is multi-stage recipes. Use Ponder for a better explanation."]
	quest.3F5C2249AD1A1556.quest_subtitle: "The Touchening"
	quest.4028EFD528F6A15B.quest_desc: ["The Goal of the pack is to have fun and fully automate the \"&3&o&lFactory medal&r\""]
	quest.4028EFD528F6A15B.quest_subtitle: "&l&fClick the images on the sides to go to their respective link!"
	quest.431A6DACBC532E9C.quest_desc: [
		"How to get:"
		""
		"kill your pet dog with Caliburn"
	]
	quest.43558BB22D8FB5B2.quest_desc: ["A Mechanical Saw is used primarily in cutting recipes and can chop down tress automatically."]
	quest.43558BB22D8FB5B2.quest_subtitle: "Saw XI (Real)"
	quest.436B8D565234B383.quest_desc: ["Used essentially like RAM, keeps track of pattern recipes while they are being used."]
	quest.436B8D565234B383.quest_subtitle: "Computer Builder"
	quest.44D8FA7C45D9DFE8.quest_desc: ["The Gearbox can be used to shift rotation across conflicting axes. It can also be turned vertical."]
	quest.44D8FA7C45D9DFE8.quest_subtitle: "Move That Gear Up"
	quest.45FB3CEE6CA9788C.quest_desc: ["4096 bytes"]
	quest.45FB3CEE6CA9788C.quest_subtitle: "Better Than 1k"
	quest.4A74FC41E303DBE1.quest_desc: ["An early-game low-cost solution to crushing."]
	quest.4A74FC41E303DBE1.quest_subtitle: "Crushed Dreams"
	quest.4F14986407115E54.quest_desc: ["Dried Kelp is used to make belts."]
	quest.4F14986407115E54.quest_subtitle: "Fossil Fuels Jumpscare"
	quest.532AA0CCB26497F2.quest_desc: ["Dense Fluix Cables can transport up to 128 (32 default) channels at a time."]
	quest.532AA0CCB26497F2.quest_subtitle: "Google Fiber"
	quest.5383242CB3EE45CA.quest_desc: ["Funnels are used to automatically tansfer items in and out of machines, typically on to belts."]
	quest.5383242CB3EE45CA.quest_subtitle: "Pop Goes The Weasel"
	quest.55154A75E797C83C.quest_desc: [
		"Storage cells have limits of size, and limits of types, plus you need to consider the resource usage of your cells, to decide what your best options are. Each storage cell can store a fixed amount of data. Each type consumes a number of bytes (which varies with the cell size), and each item consumes one bit of storage, so eight items consume one byte, and a full stack of 64 consumes 8 bytes, regardless of how the item would stack outside an ME network. For instance, 64 identical saddles don't take up more space than 64 stone."
		"All Storage Cells have a fixed type limit of 63."
	]
	quest.55154A75E797C83C.quest_subtitle: "Limitations :'("
	quest.55154A75E797C83C.title: "Types N' Bytes"
	quest.55A0FF52D77863E1.quest_desc: ["Trains are inbound! They are very interesting, with uses ranging from transportation to mining."]
	quest.55A0FF52D77863E1.quest_subtitle: "I Like Trains"
	quest.563EF8A08FBDA53A.quest_desc: ["A Mechanical Belt can be used in conjunction with Shafts to create Conveyor Belts, which can both transfer rotational energy and items."]
	quest.563EF8A08FBDA53A.quest_subtitle: "The  B E L T"
	quest.56D9AB936BB186A4.quest_desc: ["Brass Casing are typically used in Create machines that more allign with assisting automation, rather than producing an item."]
	quest.56D9AB936BB186A4.quest_subtitle: "Brains of The Brass"
	quest.5830B41EC6AB470C.quest_desc: ["This is the heart of AE2, each of the six faces of the block have a throughput of 32 channels. Channels are used to connect devices, each device taking up one channel. If the channel limit is reached no new devices can be added to the network."]
	quest.5830B41EC6AB470C.quest_subtitle: "Amazon Warehouse"
	quest.5830B41EC6AB470C.title: "&3&lME &b&lController"
	quest.59A73B4471026F94.quest_desc: ["I suggest you use ponder, I would not be able to effectively communicate how these work through this description."]
	quest.59A73B4471026F94.quest_subtitle: "Platform Nine and Three-Quarters"
	quest.5B4D38DFE52190B9.quest_desc: ["Used to Smelt Ores, and other things (Obviously)"]
	quest.5FB603AD29289D1F.quest_desc: ["Used to Convert Redstone Flux (RF) --> Stress Units (SU)"]
	quest.5FB603AD29289D1F.quest_subtitle: "Hopefully Won't Explode Like My friend's Car's Engine"
	quest.6025FFB96E5D19C1.quest_desc: ["Super Glue, as the name implies, is glue used to bind blocks to each other, typically for multiblock creations."]
	quest.6025FFB96E5D19C1.quest_subtitle: "My Gloo Cannon"
	quest.60759B40C3D195CC.quest_desc: ["Access your AE2 Network wirelessly."]
	quest.60759B40C3D195CC.quest_subtitle: "5G Towers Required"
	quest.62334A3481A08190.quest_desc: ["The Smart Fluix Cable differs in one primary way from the regular Fluix Cable: It allows you to see how many channels are being used at a given time. (It also looks cooler.)"]
	quest.62334A3481A08190.quest_subtitle: "Certified Internet Maintenance"
	quest.63F3D06137B0D9C4.quest_desc: ["Used to automatically mine blocks. Most common applications are as a tunnel bore or on a cobble gen."]
	quest.63F3D06137B0D9C4.quest_subtitle: "The Dig of 23"
	quest.65626C8A063243DA.quest_desc: [
