	quest.66C383F9C91B5B51.quest_desc: ["&bApplied Energistics 2 is a mod centered around mass storage and automation. The first thing you'll need is an insciber, a long with the four types of inscriber plates. These can be found inside meteors that can be found both scattered around the surface and underground. The meteors can be tracked with a meteorite compass."]
	quest.66C383F9C91B5B51.quest_subtitle: "Digital Storage Extravanza"
	quest.66C383F9C91B5B51.title: "&c&lWelcome To AE2"
	quest.67BA6B1F28FE633A.quest_desc: ["The hand crank can be used for quick rotaitonal energy. But it is weak and only provides a small amount of rotational energy. It also drains your hunger quicker."]
	quest.67BA6B1F28FE633A.quest_subtitle: "Manual Labor"
	quest.68D3E31EA2BB2566.quest_desc: ["Alot of stuff will either not exist (like in create chapter it wont have addons, this is because i either dont know the mods or how to word them so if youd like to contribute to that you can either PR on github those quests or join the discord and submit em :)"]
	quest.68D3E31EA2BB2566.quest_subtitle: "&b&lPLEASE READ"
	quest.68E2E8F18411DFE4.quest_desc: ["The small cogwheel can be used in conjunction with shafts to transfer rotational energy."]
	quest.68E2E8F18411DFE4.quest_subtitle: "Tiny Rotation"
	quest.6CE7A85A9B6BBF6F.quest_desc: ["Precision Mechanisms are used in very advanced Create recipes and require deployers to craft. The crafting process is long and expensive, if you cant figure it out, look up a Youtube tutorial."]
	quest.6CE7A85A9B6BBF6F.quest_subtitle: "Discount Gregification"
	quest.71477858C5C6FABE.quest_desc: ["the guide for mahou tsukai, itll explain how to do stuff way better than i can."]
	quest.74AFE45A5AF771EB.quest_desc: ["The Crafter is Create's solution to autocrafting, each crafter block representing one crafting slot. However, the slots can exceed the standard 3x3x3, which allows for bigger machines to be constructed."]
	quest.74AFE45A5AF771EB.quest_subtitle: "Big Crafting"
	quest.751D3038B889213E.quest_desc: ["Wireless AE2 Network access and crafting."]
	quest.751D3038B889213E.quest_subtitle: "IPhone 16"
	quest.790A8EB5762D4CF4.quest_desc: ["64k drives are enough to satisfy most casual AE2 users. Unless your looking for massive-scale automation, it is advised to stop here. 65536 Bytes"]
	quest.790A8EB5762D4CF4.quest_subtitle: "The End of Casuals"
	quest.7A0732FB59C4AFEC.quest_desc: ["The Engineering Processor is an essential component in all storage-related AE2 recipes."]
	quest.7A0732FB59C4AFEC.quest_subtitle: "The Engineer is Engihear"
	quest.7A0732FB59C4AFEC.title: "&3&lEngineering Processor"
	quest.7A770244B621D78D.quest_desc: ["Typically used in conjunction with logic processors for things such as better terminals, upgrade cards, and higher tier storage components."]
