	quest.7E23C7EEB30B5180.quest_desc: ["The water wheel is the easiest, but also weakest rotational source in the game. It will spin very slow, and have a low stress capacity. Stress is essentially a limit for how many different Create Contraptions can be used on one rotational network. If it is reached, everything will stop working. This can be counteracted by adding more waterwheels."]
